40591\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"DSC Prize South Asian Literature Wikipedia winners\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d75\"},\"ref\":\"d75\",\"snippet\":\" ... List of Polish people - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2002-12-17\\n---\\nThis is a partial list of notable Polish or Polish-speaking or -writing people. People of partial Polish heritage have their respective ancestries credited.\\n\\nPhysics\\n\\n*Miedziak Antal\\n* Czesław Białobrzeski\\n* Andrzej Buras\\n* Georges Charpak, 1995 Nobel Prize\\n* Jan Kazimierz Danysz ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Polish_people\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d76\"},\"ref\":\"d76\",\"snippet\":\" ... She has been a Miles Morland Foundation Writing Scholar (UK), a Writer-in-Residence at the Jan Michalski Foundation for Writing and Literature (Switzerland), a Maison Baldwin St. Paul de Vence Writer-in-Residence (France), an Austrian Federal Chancellery/KulturKontakt Artist-in-Residence (Austria), and has held fellowships ... \",\"title\":\"https://cmsw.mit.edu/people/lecturers/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d77\"},\"ref\":\"d77\",\"snippet\":\" ... But the ideal space would be this luxury treehouse, at the Jan Michalski Foundation. That's literally the ideal for most people, I would think. Anything that has a little bit of access to nature so that you can take a walk when you need a break.\\n\\nYou ... \",\"title\":\"https://thecreativeindependent.com/people/author-and-translator-jennifer-croft-on-challenging-preconceived-notions/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d78\"},\"ref\":\"d78\",\"snippet\":\" ... Development's 2023 Outstanding Paper Prize Available\\nauthor: James Briscoe\\ndate: 2024-04-29\\n---\\nWe are delighted to announce the winners of Development's Outstanding Paper Prize for papers published in 2023. Initiated last year (Briscoe et al., 2023), this prize highlights some of the best research published ... \",\"title\":\"https://journals.biologists.com/dev/article/151/8/dev202948/347021/Development-s-2023-Outstanding-Paper-Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d79\"},\"ref\":\"d79\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2008)\\n\\n- Jan 16 Ezra Sims, American composer of microtonal music, born in Birmingham, Alabama (d. 2015)\\n\\n- Jan 16 Pilar Lorengar [Lorenza Pilar García], Aragones soprano, born in El Gancho, Zaragoza, Spain (d. 1996)\\n\\n- Jan 17 Jean Barraqué, French composer, born in Hauts-de-Seine, France (d. 1973)\\n\\n- Jan ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.onthisday.com/music/birthdays/date/1928\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d80\"},\"ref\":\"d80\",\"snippet\":\" ... She is a recipient of the Rome Prize in Literature as well as fellowships from the Lannan, Jan Michalski and Santa Maddalena Foundations. She teaches in the creative writing program at New York University. Her new novel, Audition, will be published by Riverhead Books in 2025.\\n\\nShe will ... \",\"title\":\"https://manor-mill.com/prose-authors\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d81\"},\"ref\":\"d81\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2019, he was writer-in-residence at the Jan Michalski Foundation in Switzerland, where he worked on his third novel. He is currently on a 14-month, 49-state road trip in his 1979 VW bus, while he and his wife, Miracle, produce a podcast called \\\"So ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.writersdigest.com/wd-competitions/announcing-the-winners-of-the-90th-annual-writers-digest-writing-competition\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her debut novel We That Are Young won the 2018 Desmond Elliott Prize and was also nominated for international awards including the Rathbones Folio Prize, the Jan Michalski Prize and the Shakti Bhatt First Book Award. It was a Book of the Decade in The Hindu, a top ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.andotherstories.org/about-us/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"b3a0874c060a39f62e14aefa4ed1f017f35aa34bfa76dea3e664a9e08db39f3a\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"0ba0d5f2b053b5e8d97f5ac4059098cc25f9b6044e82c1472210557d4eac5fb4\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Jan Michalski Prize Wikipedia\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_f7331b23afce4a04b9535d15"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle structure carefully. The key constraint is \"an award originally created in the 2000s.\" Let me think about awards created in the 2000s and look at the Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia page directly.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize 2012 shortlist Between Clay and Dust\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize 2011 2012 2013 winner\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_beb02a5b1ddc4d6f97fe0200","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok